{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://img.tvb.com/inews_admin/pro/20260512/entry_horizontal_6a026ba30e378355ed7584cc_1778545952634_640x360.jpg\"><p>燕之屋擬於公開市場以不多於一億元回購H股。</p><p>涉及回購股數不超過4,616萬股，以展示公司對自身業務展望及前景充滿信心，並可提高對股東的回報。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-12T00:52:52.595428+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":70,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}